h Alliance, your mission is to bring peace and safety back to our solar system, one planet at a time, starting at home: planet Earth.\n\nBegin with a few easy training missions and progress to harder campaigns, upgrading your ship with weapons and utilities along the way, and track your rank in the leaderboards. Each mission has a different goal, from protecting important structures and figuring out puzzles to destroying alien bosses.\n\nA swivel chair is required to allow 360\u00b0 rotations. Gamepad recommended.\n\nVisit earthoriginvr.com/hints for tips.", "short_description": "Blast aliens, steer through winding tunnels, and explore the most dangerous corners of our solar system. This fast-paced space shooter puts you in the heat of the action, zipping past asteroids with enemies on your tail."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://earthoriginvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://earthoriginvr.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Cryofrog Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://earthoriginvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SHOOTER", "SIMULATION", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "478017913770019"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138943_916646121769711_503003776316080128_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nGwbr_-u8a0Q7kNvwFQfzAp&_nc_oc=AdnquYZZIVEG_Zz--3LuFHjx